    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 Beta 1 的发布公告正在定稿",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 Beta 1 的发布公告正在邮件列表上打磨，Jonathan Katz 逐条收集功能描述和措辞意见。Florents Tselai 建议补上 GROUP BY ALL，并改写 jsonpath 字符串函数一节，两条都被采纳：公告会说明 GROUP BY ALL 把非聚合、非窗口的输出列自动并入分组。Tom Lane 建议把 parameters 改成输出列，以免和函数参数混淆。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/a9d91900-f0c6-4cf3-86aa-eb43b45d97b1@postgresql.org",
      "author": "Jonathan Katz",
      "source": "pgsql-hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-06-03",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "发布"
      ],
      "position": 1
